      "text": "Irrigation & Waterways Dept, Govt of West\nBengal\nOffice of the Executive Engineer · West Bengal · IN\nNo. CC/22/2023/120\nDated: 31 Mar 2026\nCERTIFICATE OF COMPLETION OF WORK\nThis is to certify that the work of  “Highway Tunnel — West Bengal Pkg-120” (tunnels),\nawarded  to  M/s  National  Infrastructure  Corp.  Ltd.  (GSTIN  19NAICC4417O1Z1,  PAN\nNAICC4417O) , has been completed in all respects on 20 May 2023 at a gross executed value\nof Rs. 7466.00 Lakh (Rupees 74.66 Crore Only).\nOn joint measurement and final inspection, the executed quantities were found in order and\nthe workmanship conforming to the technical specifications forming part of the contract.\nThe work was supervised on the contractor's side by Rahul Menon. This certificate is issued for\nrecord and for submission with future tenders wherever the contractor is required to establish\npast performance.\nExecutive Engineer\nIrrigation & Waterways Dept, Govt of West Bengal\nDOC-CC-120\nPage 1 of 1\n",
